  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういえばさ\r\n最近、ユニットでもソロでも仕事増えてきただろ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね、とてもありがたいことだと思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、ありがたいし、嬉しいことなんだけど……\r\nちゃんと休めているか心配になってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "大丈夫です\r\nちゃんと休んだりリフレッシュしたり、できているので……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "次の休みに、真乃とめぐるが好きそうなイベントがあって\r\n誘ってみようかと考えているんです",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "次の休みか、それはいい──\r\n…………あ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、すまん……\r\nその日、ふたりとも仕事が入ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……？\r\nその日はオフだって、聞いていたんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。ちょっと急なオファーがあってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そうでしたか\r\nじゃあ、また別の機会にします",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "悪いな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーのせいじゃありません\r\n私が勝手に誘おうかなって思っていただけです",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それに、仕事をいただけるのはいいことだと思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今さ、ふたりとも\r\nオファーが来るとほぼすべて受けてくれるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\n忙しいって言いながら、とても楽しそうです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これまでこなしたことのない量だったから、聞いたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今のペースはきつくないか？　って\r\nそしたら、『今はなんでもやりたいから』って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……わかる気がします",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200301/1002003010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺個人としては、体を壊さないかとか\r\nちゃんと遊べているかとか、心配でもあるけど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、みんなが意欲的なのはやっぱり嬉しいよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
